# Nightgals
var/storage/
# Real credentials. .env.example is the committed template; this never is.
#
# This comment existed without the rule under it, so .env was tracked and
# committed anyway - which is how a Gmail app password, JWT_SECRET,
# DOCUMENT_HASH_PEPPER and the MTN credentials ended up in the history.
